  "title": "BBQ Pork Tenderloin",
  "description": "Pork tenderloin is slow-cooked in a sweet, hickory-flavored BBQ sauce, resulting in either tender slices or juicy pulled pork.",
  "authors": [
    "Grey"
  ],
  "date_published": "2022-02-10T11:05:25-05:00",
